ng vers les branchies, le troisième vers le reste du corps. Son sang est bleu.","takeaway":"Pieuvre : 3 cœurs, 8 bras, sang bleu.","difficulty":60,"status":"published","payload":{"decimals":0,"allow_negative":false},"answer":{"value":3,"tolerance":0}},{"external_key":"sci-101","concept_id":"science.chemistry.elements_pairs","concept_label":"Symboles chimiques","type":"pairs","prompt":"Associe chaque élément à son symbole.","explanation":"Plusieurs symboles viennent du latin : ferrum, natrium, kalium, plumbum.","difficulty":45,"status":"published","payload":{"left":[{"id":"90b19db0","text":"Fer"},{"id":"975ba107","text":"Sodium"},{"id":"63456d90","text":"Potassium"},{"id":"4623dc49","text":"Plomb"}],"right":[{"id":"baaf977b","text":"Fe"},{"id":"e8cf91ae","text":"Na"},{"id":"c4245a61","text":"K"},{"id":"eb200006","text":"Pb"}]},"answer":{"pairs":{"90b19db0":"baaf977b","975ba107":"e8cf91ae","63456d90":"c4245a61","4623dc49":"eb200006"}}},{"external_key":"sci-102","concept_id":"science.physics.water_boiling","concept_label":"Ébullition de l''eau","type":"true_false","prompt":"Au sommet du mont Blanc, l''eau bout à moins de 100 °C.","explanation":"La pression de l''air y est plus faible : l''eau bout vers 85 °C. Les pâtes cuisent donc plus lentement en altitude.","difficulty":45,"status":"published","payload":{},"answer":{"value":true}},{"external_key":"sci-103","concept_id":"science.space.planets_size_order","concept_label":"Planètes par taille","type":"ordering","prompt":"Classe ces planètes de la plus grande à la plus petite.","explanation":"Jupiter est la plus grande planète du Système solaire, suivie de Saturne. La Terre est environ deux fois plus large que Mars.","difficulty":45,"status":"published","payload":{"items":[{"id":"160509ee","text":"Jupiter"},{"id":"c3683e59","text":"Saturne"},{"id":"c00d011b","text":"Terre"},{"id":"dfbf13cf","text":"Mars"}]},"answer":{"order":["160509ee","c3683e59","c00d011b","dfbf13cf"]}},{"external_key":"sci-104","concept_id":"science.